# Development only. Copy to .env (which is ignored by git) and fill in the key.
#
# The CLI and the tray read this file when started from the checkout. Users of
# an installed build never see it: their key goes into the OS keychain through
# the setup window or `eecc-redact key set`.
#
# Use a sandbox key (shr_test_...) for development; every image call on a
# production key (shr_live_...) spends records.
SHINRAI_API_KEY=
